-- input.md --
Price $5 each. [Buy](/r/demo/shop$help&func=Buy)

[Send $10](/r/demo/bank$help&func=Send) or pay $x$.

Pay $5 at <https://example.com/pay$now>.

Pay $3 with [call](/r/demo/f(a)$help).

Brackets in math still close: $[a](b) + c$.

